></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>_write_blocks: *<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> (*<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/os/uefi/protocol/block_io/#std.os.uefi.protocol.block_io.BlockIo\">BlockIo</a>, media_id: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>, lba: <span class=\"tok-type\">u64</span>, buffer_size: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>, buf: [*]<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>) <span class=\"tok-kw\">callconv</span>(<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/os/uefi/#std.os.uefi.cc\">cc</a>) <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/os/uefi/status/#std.os.uefi.status.Status\">Status</a></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>_flush_blocks: *<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> (*<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/os/uefi/protocol/block_io/#std.os.uefi.protocol.block_io.BlockIo\">BlockIo</a>) <span class=\"tok-kw\">callconv</span>(<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/os/uefi/#std.os.uefi.cc\">cc</a>) <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/os/uefi/status/#std.os.uefi.status.Status\">Status</a></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"api-members\"><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/os/uefi/protocol/block_io/#std.os.uefi.protocol.block_io.BlockIo\"><code>Self</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/os/uefi/protocol/block_io/#std.os.uefi.protocol.block_io.BlockIo.ResetError\"><code>ResetError</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/os/uefi/protocol/block_io/#std.os.uefi.protocol.block_io.BlockIo.ReadBlocksError\"><code>ReadBlocksError</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/os/uefi/protocol/block_io/#std.os.uefi.protocol.block_io.BlockIo.WriteBlocksError\"><code>WriteBlocksError</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/os/uefi/protocol/block_io/#std.os.uefi.protocol.block_io.BlockIo.FlushBlocksError\"><code>FlushBlocksError</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/os/uefi/protocol/block_io/#std.os.uefi.protocol.block_io.BlockIo.reset\"><code>reset</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/os/uefi/protocol/block_io/#std.os.uefi.protocol.block_io.BlockIo.readBlocks\"><code>readBlocks</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/os/uefi/protocol/block_io/#std.os.uefi.protocol.block_io.BlockIo.writeBlocks\"><code>writeBlocks</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/os/uefi/protocol/block_io/#std.os.uefi.protocol.block_io.BlockIo.flushBlocks\"><code>flushBlocks</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/os/uefi/protocol/block_io/#std.os.uefi.protocol.block_io.BlockIo.guid\"><code>guid</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/os/uefi/protocol/block_io/#std.os.uefi.protocol.block_io.BlockIo.BlockMedia\"><code>BlockMedia</code></a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.os.uefi.protocol.block_io.BlockIo.BlockMedia\"><h3><code>std.os.uefi.protocol.block_io.BlockIo.BlockMedia</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">容器</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L91\">第 91 行</a></p>\n<h4>字段</h4><div class=\"api-fields\">\n<pre><code>media_id: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>当前介质 ID。介质更改时，此值也随之更改。</p>\n</div>\n<pre><code>removable_media: <span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>若介质可移除，则为 <code>true</code>；否则为 <code>false</code>。</p>\n</div>\n<pre><code>media_present: <span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>设备中当前有介质时为 <code>true</code></p>\n</div>\n<pre><code>logical_partition: <span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>若 <code><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/os/uefi/protocol/block_io/#std.os.uefi.protocol.block_io.BlockIo\">BlockIo</a></code> 用于抽象磁盘上的分区结构，\n则为 <code>true</code>。若 <code><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/os/uefi/protocol/block_io/#std.os.uefi.protocol.block_io.BlockIo\">BlockIo</a></code> 用于\n抽象硬件设备上的逻辑块，则为 <code>false</code>。</p>\n</div>\n<pre><code>read_only: <span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>介质标记为只读时为 <code>true</code>，否则为 <code>false</code>。此字段\n反映最近一次 <code>WriteBlocks()</code> 时的只读状态</p>\n</div>\n<pre><code>write_caching: <span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>若 WriteBlocks() 函数缓存写入数据，则为 <code>true</code>。</p>\n</div>\n<pre><code>block_size: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>设备固有的块大小。若介质更换，则此</p>\n</div>\n<pre><code>io_align: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>规定数据传输所用任意缓冲区的对齐要求。\nIoAlign 为 0 或 1 表示缓冲区可以位于内存中的任意位置。\n否则，IoAlign 必须为 2 的幂，且缓冲区起始地址必须能被 IoAlign 整除，不能有余数。</p>\n</div>\n<pre><code>last_block: <span class=\"tok-type\">u64</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>设备上的最后一个 LBA。如果介质变化，则更新此字段。</p>\n</div>\n<pre><code>lowest_aligned_lba: <span class=\"tok-type\">u64</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>logical_blocks_per_physical_block: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>optimal_transfer_length_granularity: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.os.uefi.protocol.block_io.BlockIo.flushBlocks\"><h3><code>std.os.uefi.protocol.block_io.BlockIo.flushBlocks</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L73\">第 73 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>将所有已修改数据刷新到物理块设备。</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">flushBlocks</span>(self: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/os/uefi/protocol/block_io/#std.os.uefi.protocol.block_io.BlockIo\">Self</a>) <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/os/uefi/protocol/block_io/#std.os.uefi.protocol.block_io.BlockIo.FlushBlocksError\">FlushBlocksError</a>!<